    <h2 id="aboutStoryHeading">Built around honest advice and people who know the products.</h2>
    <p>Yonkers Paint &amp; Hardware began in <strong>1966</strong> as a small family-run paint shop with a simple promise: honest advice, reliable products and neighbors helping neighbors.</p>
    <p>As the business grew, the shop moved just around the corner into the larger building it occupies today at <strong>{{ site.address.street }}</strong> in downtown Yonkers.</p>
    <p>Today, the store is a full-service hardware destination with Benjamin Moore&reg; paint, lumber, tools, plumbing and electrical supplies, plus a complete locksmith counter under our sister banner, <strong>{{ site.partner.name }}</strong>.</p>
  </div>
